rkable fibrofatty tissue REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm and REMOVED_DATE x 1 x 0 2cm  which are entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Unfixed  labeled  Theresa Bohnenberger  REMOVED_DATE  right breast final margin medial   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm piece of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  which is entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Unfixed  labeled  Theresa Bohnenberger  REMOVED_DATE  right breast final margin lateral   are two pieces of unremarkable fibrofatty tissue REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  which are entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1  FX 1A  FX 1B   SENTINEL NODE   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY IN 3 NODES  Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   Electronically signed on Tuesday REMOVED_MONTH 15   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 11 56 57AM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON   1 QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Right  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  The tumor cells do not show overexpression of HER 2 c erbB 2  See note  Note  Estrogen and progesterone receptor quantitation  The percent of immunoreactive nuclei in the tumor cells is assessed visually and reported as follows    The tumor cells stain    10  of nuclei stained    Some tumor cells stain  1 to  10  of nuclei stained    Rare tumor cells stain    1  of nuclei stained    The tumor cells do not stain  0  of nuclei stained  HER 2 c erbB 2 quantitation  the tumor cells membrane immunoreactivity is evaluated visually and reported as follows    Do not show overexpression  0 to 1   no minimal immunoreactivity or incomp