n  nodular tissue with focal areas of hemorrhage  The cavity approaches to within 0 5cm of the inferior margin  0 5cm of the deep margins  and 0 8cm of the lateral margin  Section code  A  Radial section through skin and deeper tissues B  Inferolateral deep margin C  Superolateral deep margin D I Deep margin  superior from lateral to medial J N Deep margin  inferior from lateral to medial O  Medial section en face Labeled  Left axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm mass of lobulated fibro adipose tissue  with several sutures attached  Sectioning reveals the presence of 13 lymph nodes which range in size from 0 2cm to 1 8cm in greatest dimension  Section code  P  Four lymph nodes Q  One lymph node  bisected R  One lymph node  bisected S  Four lymph nodes T  One lymph node U  Two lymph nodes Labeled  Additional axillary tissue  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm aggregate of adipose tissue which contains what appear to be four small  0 2cm in diamter lymph nodes  in D  Resident  Robin E  Kirby  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Benjamin Alan Spencer  M D  PART A  BREAST MASS  RE EXCISION  PART B  AXILLARY NODE CONTENTS  LEFT  PART C  ADDITIONAL AXILLARY TISSUE , Unchecked.
