Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  02 MAY 03 ACCESSIONED ON  02 MAY 03 at 11 32 CLINICAL DATA  Right breast cancer                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY  1  FOCAL DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  GRADE 1  ADJACENT TO LATERAL BIOPSY SITE AND FAR AWAY FROM RESECTION MARGINS  2  FOCAL ATYPICAL DUCTAL HYPERPLASIA  3  SECOND BIOPSY SITE IN SUPERIOR LOCATION  4  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY IN 22 AXILLARY LYMPH NODES  Diagnosis by  MELINDA J  FAN  MD Signed On  08 MAY 03 at 17 25                                                                                 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm breast with REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm of attached axillary tissue  The overlying tan REMOVED_DATE x 10 3cm skin has an eccentrically located REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm unremarkable everted nipple  There are 2 well healed linear scars 4 0cm apart  The first  3 5cm superior to the nipple  measures 5 0cm in length  the other  5 2cm lateral to the nipple  measures 3 0cm in length  The specimen is inked blue along the anterior and black along the posterior  Contiguous with the superior scar is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm gray white  firm  stellate area consistent with a biopsy site  which comes to 1 5cm of the posterior and 2 0cm of the anterior margin  Located 5 0cm lateral and inferior to this cavity  contiguous with the second  lateral  scar is an additional REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm tan gray  firm stellate area consistent with a biopsy site  which comes to 2 0cm of the anterior and 2 8cm of the posterior margins  The remaining cut surface consists of unremarkable fibrofatty breast tissue  Within the axillary fat  multiple tan  rubbery lymph nodes ranging from 0 3cm to 2 0cm are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODES  A C  superior cavity  D   posterior margin closest to superior cavity  E   anterior margin closest to superior cavity  F H  lateral cavity  I   anterior margin closest to lateral cavity  J   posterior margin closest to lateral cavity  K   parenchyma between both cavities  L M  parenchyma away from both cavities  N Q  whole lymph nodes  multiple per cassette  R   one lymph node bisected  S T  one lymph node sectioned  Gross Description by  CHRISTINE D AMATO Resident  ELENA BRACHTEL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
